  "notes": "Code round2-003 of the release https://github.com/MarinAndreGirard/qubit-stabilizer-codes-2026 (codes/stabilizers/n062_k033_d07.txt). d >= 7 was proved by an exhaustive meet-in-the-middle search over all Paulis of weight <= 3 with a visit count equal to the closed form; see verify/ in the release. At its (n, k) the codetables.de lower bound on 4 November 2026 was below 7. No stabilizer-board entry has these (n, k); no equivalence is expected."
